 num('OS','Median OS · end-of-study',57.1,40.8,' months','Pertuzumab strategy','Placebo strategy','Time from randomization to death.','Historical overall-survival benefit.','Descriptive final follow-up, 2020','Median 99.9 versus 98.7 months','cleop_os',hr='0.69',ci='0.58–0.82',limitations='Does not identify a separate maintenance effect or optimal docetaxel duration.'),
